# 🦊 Aulaf

Local AI assistant for managing thoughts, transcriptions, and Daily Logs.

Uses [Ollama](https://ollama.ai) to run entirely locally - your data never leaves your machine.

---

## 🚀 Quick Start

### Prerequisites

- Python 3.10+
- [Ollama](https://ollama.ai) installed
```bash
# Install Ollama model
ollama pull mistral
```

### Installation
```bash
git clone https://github.com/your-username/aulaf.git
cd aulaf
pip install typer rich ollama
```

### Usage
```bash
# One-shot chat
python aulaf.py chat "Hello!"

# Interactive mode
python aulaf.py chat
```

---

